abstract: >-
  The I·V·O Lens is a domain-independent framework for structural observation
  and analysis using three operators: O (Possibility Space), V (Relational
  Change), and I (Observation / Distinction), with complementary OVI generative
  and IVO analytical reading directions.
keywords:
  - systems thinking
  - structural analysis
  - observation
  - relational change
  - possibility space
  - AI prompting
  - design research
